<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - July 25.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - July 25.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain</p>
<p>trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Jul 82.00 Sep 81.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk Oct 85.00 Oct/Dec 85.00 Jan/Mar 87.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire Oct/Dec 85.50 Jan/Mar 89.00</p>
<p>Lincolnshire Oct/Dec 85.50</p>
<p>Avon range Oct/Dec 85.00</p>
<p>Gloucester Sep 79.00</p>
<p>Devon Sep 78.50</p>
<p>Feed barley to East Anglia asa 72.50/73.00 Oct/Dec 81.00</p>
<p>Jan/Mar 84.00</p>
<p>Avon four asa 73.50/73.00</p>
<p>Tilbury asa 82.00</p>
</text>
